  "description": "Visit the Discord to apply! \n\nThe Wevanent&#039;s main focus is having at least two daily raids with a lot of guild participation. We also do as many guild challenges as possible so we can continue raiding.\n\nGuild requirements are specified in the IdleMMO and The Wevanent Discord servers.\nhttps://discord.gg/wC9vzU5ddH\n\nMultiple days of inactivity will result in you being kicked from the guild. \n\nRaids are run at 00:00 UTC and 12:00 UTC\n\n(This description may be outdated, for the most up to date info, check discord)",
